<title>USA: Cliffs Drilling applies for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Cliffs Drilling applies for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cliffs Drilling Co applied on Friday to have its shares listed on the New York Stock Exchange, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The company anticipates that its common shares will begin trading during the first week of April, 1997,&quot; said Cliffs, which is an offshore contract drilling company.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
